      "path": "inputs/severity-one-response.md",
      "content": "# Severity-one response\n\nThe on-call lead must acknowledge a severity-one incident within 15 minutes. The incident channel records the acknowledgement time."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/severity-one-containment.md",
      "content": "# Severity-one containment\n\nThe Security Commander owns containment decisions for severity-one incidents. Containment begins after impact is confirmed."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/visitor-badge.md",
      "content": "# Visitor badges\n\nA visitor badge remains valid for 12 hours. The employee host submits the badge request."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/contractor-badge.md",
      "content": "# Contractor badges\n\nA contractor badge remains valid for five days and requires approval from the Facilities Manager."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/media-retention.md",
      "content": "# Media recordings\n\nApproved interview recordings are retained for 90 days in the communications archive."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/audit-retention.md",
      "content": "# Audit logs\n\nAdministrative audit logs are retained for 13 months in the compliance vault."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/cold-chain-shipping.md",
      "content": "# Cold-chain shipping\n\nArctic Express carries refrigerated parcels. Each parcel must remain between 2 and 8 degrees Celsius."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/hazardous-shipping.md",
      "content": "# Hazardous shipping\n\nSafeTrans carries hazardous parcels. Hazardous parcels may not travel on passenger aircraft."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/database-backup.md",
      "content": "# Database backups\n\nThe production backup starts at 01:00 UTC every day. Encrypted copies are kept in the recovery region."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/restore-testing.md",
      "content": "# Restore testing\n\nA full restoration test runs once every quarter. The resilience team records the result."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/admin-export.md",
      "content": "# Administrator exports\n\nAdministrators may export billing records after entering a ticket number. Export events are audited."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/guest-export.md",
      "content": "# Guest exports\n\nGuest accounts cannot export billing records. Guests may only view the sample dashboard."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/plant-access.md",
      "content": "# Plant access\n\nThe Plant Manager approves access to the assembly floor. Approved access expires after 30 days."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/laboratory-access.md",
      "content": "# Laboratory access\n\nThe Laboratory Director approves access to the clean laboratory. Safety training is required first."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/pump-inspection.md",
      "content": "# Pump inspection\n\nOperators inspect the cooling pump every eight hours and record pressure and vibration."
    },
    {
      "path": "inputs/valve-inspection.md",
      "content": "# Valve inspection\n\nTechnicians inspect the relief valve every Friday and record seal condition."
    }
  ],
